      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The name South Bound Brook comes from a brook that served as a boundary in a Native American deed, highlighting the area's historical significance.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Bound_Brook%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Abraham Staats House in South Bound Brook, New Jersey, served as the headquarters for Baron Von Steuben during the Revolutionary War and is now a museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        10,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
