      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_Bound_Brook%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1761, a wooden bridge over the Raritan River in South Bound Brook was erected, later becoming a covered bridge used during the Revolutionary War.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
